OverTheWire Bandit: Level 4 → 5

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 5.
The password is stored in the only human-readable file inside the inhere directory.

Steps
Log in as bandit4:
ssh bandit4@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Check file types in the directory:
file inhere/*
Identify the human-readable file and read it:
cat inhere/<filename>

Result
The readable file contains the password for Bandit Level 5.
